{"sourceUrl":"https://geography.nuist.edu.cn/2025/0916/c1967a290120/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:56.743349+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://geography.nuist.edu.cn/2025/0916/c1967a290120/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span><strong>地理科学学院</strong></span><span><strong>2026</strong></span><span><strong>年推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）研究生复试及录取细则</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://geography.nuist.edu.cn/2025/0916/c1967a290120/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>根据《南京信息工程大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年招收推荐免试研究生章程》《南京信息工程大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年推荐免试研究生复试及录取工作指导意见》《南京信息工程大学关于招收</span><span>2025</span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试直博攻读博士学位的通知》等文件精神，结合学院实际，现制定地理科学学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）研究生复试及录取细则。</span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>一、招生</strong></span><span><strong>专业</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span>我院拟招收推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）学位研究生的招生专业见表</span><span>1</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>表</span><span>1</span><span></span><span>地理科学学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年拟招收推荐免试硕士（博士）研究生专业简表</span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><strong>学院代码</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>学院名称</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>研究方向名称</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>学制</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>学习方式</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>备注</strong></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>004</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>地理科学学院</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>070500</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>地理学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>3</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士生</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>0706Z5</span></p></td><td><p><span>3S</span><span>集成与气象应用</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>3</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士生</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td><p><span>03</span><span>4</span></p></td><td><p><span>南信大</span><span>-</span><span>国科大南京学院联培基地（卓越人才培养计划）</span></p></td><td><p><span>070500</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>地理学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>3</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士生</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td><p><span>004</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>地理科学学院</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>0706Z5</span></p></td><td><p><span>3S</span><span><span>集成与气象应用</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>-</span></p></td><td><p><span>5</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>直博生</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td><p><span>004</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>地理科学学院</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>0706Z8</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>地表圈层与过程</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>-</span></p></td><td><p><span>5</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>直博生</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span>录取的推荐免试研究生占用学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年的招生名额。招收的推荐免试硕士生人数不超过</span><span>2025</span><span>年各专业硕士录取数的</span><span>50%</span><span>，招收的推荐免试直博生人数不超过</span><span>2025</span><span>年学院博士录取数的</span><span>20%</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span><strong>二、申请条件</strong></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，政治思想表现好，品德良好，诚信守法，身心健康，须符合《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》要求，愿为祖国建设服务；</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>在校期间各方面表现良好，历年大学成绩优良，基础扎实，具有较强的自学能力、实践能力和创新能力，学术研究兴趣浓厚；</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>具有推荐免试资格高校的优秀应届本科毕业生，能获得母校推荐免试资格；</span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><span><span>学风端正，无考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>免试直博生还需满足下列条件：</span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>外语水平须达到以下条件之一：国家英语六级</span></span><span>425</span><span><span>分以上、或托福</span></span><span>80</span><span><span>分（含</span></span><span>80</span><span><span>分）以上、或雅思</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>分（含</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>分）以上、或</span></span><span>PETS-5 60</span><span><span>分（含</span></span><span>60</span><span><span>分）以上或以第一作者发表过英文文章；</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>本科阶段在核心及以上学术刊物发表论文、各类学科竞赛或综合竞赛获省级以上奖励者、从事过科技活动获奖或表现突出者，同等情况下可优先考虑。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>三、申请程序</strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>申请者需要提交以下材料：</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>）本人学生证、身份证复印件各一份；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span><span>）国家级外语考试成绩或合格证书复印件一份；</span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span><span>）本科学习成绩单一份，要求加盖所在学校教务处公章（红章原件）；</span></span></p><p><span>4</span><span>）《南京信息工程大学报考研究生思想品德考核表》（附件</span><span>1</span><span>）一份，要求加盖所在学院公章（红章原件）；</span></p><p><span>5</span><span>）《南京信息工程大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生复试申请表》（附件</span><span>2</span><span>）或《南京信息工程大学招收优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士学位申请表》（附件</span><span>3</span><span>）；</span></p><p><span>6</span><span><span>）有公开发表的学术论文、科研成果或获奖证书者，提供复印件一份。</span></span></p><p><span>7</span><span>）免试直博生还需提交《南京信息工程大学招收优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书》（附件</span><span>4</span><span>）两份</span><span>(</span><span>需要</span><span>2</span><span>名教授或相当职称以上的专家分别推荐</span><span>)</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>申请表和复印件均请用</span></span><span>A4</span><span><span>纸。申请人提供的材料收到后不再返还，请自留底稿。</span></span></p><p><span>材料提交地点：启明楼</span><span>211</span><span>。外地考生可发送上述电子材料至邮箱：</span><span>dlkx-zs@nuist.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>材料提交截止时间：</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日下午</span><span>14:00</span></p><p><span><span><span>联系人：张老师 </span><span></span><span>电话：</span></span></span><span>025-58235140 </span></p><p><span><span><span>学院将根据申请情况分批审核，分批择优确定复试名单并发出复试通知。申请者接收到学院相关通知后，须</span><span><strong>按要求在规定时间内及时回复</strong></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span>推免复试方式为面试。</span></p><p><span>1) </span><span><span>学院成立不少于</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>人的复试考核小组（副高及以上职称），负责对申请人进行面试考核；</span></span></p><p><span>2) </span><span><span>面试主要考查申请人专业基础知识以及运用所学知识解决实际问题的能力，并注重其创新精神、创新能力以及外语水平等方面的考核，满分</span></span><span>100</span><span><span>分；面试成绩的计算方法是去掉一个最高分和一个最低分后取平均值，结果保留到小数点后三位； </span></span></p><p><span>3) </span><span><span>申请人按照抽签顺序参加面试。每位申请人面试时间为</span></span><span>10</span><span><span>分钟左右，当场面试，当场评分； </span></span></p><p><span>4) </span><span>面试时间：</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>19</span><span>日，时间、地点另行通知。申请人复试时请携带有效证件（学生证或身份 证），按规定时间报到。未按规定时间报到者，视为自动放弃复试资格。</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span><span><span>确定拟接收推</span><span>免</span><span>生名单。学院</span><span>根据</span><span>复试成绩进行排名</span><span>，确定拟接收</span><span>推</span><span>免</span><span>生</span><span>名单，</span><span>统一</span><span>报研究生</span><span>院复审</span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span>4</span><span><span>．若复试后，拟录取免试研究生名额未满，学院将根据系统填报情况另外安排补录复试。</span></span></p><p><span>5.复</span><span>试考核合格并被拟录取的推免生，接到我校在“全国推免系统”发送的拟录取通知后，应在规定时间内按要求接受并确认，否则视为自动放弃。</span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>四、</strong></span><span><strong>本</strong></span><span><strong>细则</strong></span><span><strong>解释权在</strong></span><span><strong>地理科学</strong></span><span><strong>学院。 </strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地理科学学院 </span><span></span></span></span></p><p><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://geography.nuist.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://geography.nuist.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/76/43/4e4a0777480c95e52d7c30b39b0e/9cc2ebaf-09cf-4e93-a99a-8c73009e46a1.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：思想品德考核表.doc</a></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://geography.nuist.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://geography.nuist.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/76/43/4e4a0777480c95e52d7c30b39b0e/02917732-76cb-4949-9ab4-a4c731d8bd14.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：南京信息工程大学2026年推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生复试申请表.doc</a></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://geography.nuist.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://geography.nuist.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/76/43/4e4a0777480c95e52d7c30b39b0e/a6fafb97-fe41-43d6-b771-31df96f08f97.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：南京信息工程大学招收优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士学位申请表.doc</a></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://geography.nuist.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://geography.nuist.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/76/43/4e4a0777480c95e52d7c30b39b0e/b977a00c-0263-46df-b55b-5a6b3106dff0.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件4：南京信息工程大学招收优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书.docx</a></p><p><br/></p><div><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"480dbed1ec6326f2b6bc8dbba07501d0ab78ab2525e4ea94a55a572dbab1ee6a","textLength":2051,"sourceSha256":"194aaf57c4adfe74e8c63136b1f367aeaf2af21421c66125a2699ac9d6cbc29f","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-72971ab8268d94105855","title":"2025年南京信息工程大学地理科学学院2026年推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）研究生复试及录取细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:56.743349+00:00"}
